93
00:10:48.949 --> 00:10:50.818
Listen, I, uh... no, no.
Wait, wait, wait.

94
00:10:50.851 --> 00:10:52.786
I just need a second.
I just need a second.

95
00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:54.255
Uh... look.

96
